<ul>
<li>Define the view first; query matching assets for requested spatial chunks and time steps.</li>
<li>Carry query criteria instead of the complete item collection.</li>
<li>Opening still needs a prepared index, representative items, COG headers, timestamps, and coordinates.</li>
<li>Dask remains available for scheduling and downstream work.</li>
<li>Filters, grouping, extent, and grid define the view; <code>.sel(...)</code> selects within it.</li>
</ul>
