<ul>
<li>Choose scene filters, monthly grouping, extent, target CRS, and resolution.</li>
<li>Four months, three bands, 300 m: about 333 MB logical size.</li>
<li>Combine source projections on one EPSG:3310 grid, using COG overviews and nearest-neighbor sampling.</li>
<li>Order scenes by cloud cover, then take the first valid pixel. No monthly averaging or pixel cloud mask.</li>
<li>Click: chunk to 1024 × 1024, select May, and load asynchronously.</li>
<li>Return to the opening image: the actual May result, displayed at DN 0–4000.</li>
<li>Change the view's definition by opening another array; use <code>.sel(...)</code> within this one.</li>
</ul>
